# DirectStay — environment variables
# Copy this file to `.env` for local overrides. It is not committed to git.

# Only variables prefixed with EXPO_PUBLIC_ are inlined into the client bundle.
# Never put secrets (Stripe secret keys, Supabase service-role keys) in EXPO_PUBLIC_ vars.

# EAS_BUILD_PROFILE (development | preview | production) is injected automatically by
# EAS Build and read by app.config.ts. It does not need to be set for local runs.

# EXPO_PUBLIC_APP_ENV=development